{"3880150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Life in Jasskia: a Coffee Shop", "steam_appid": 3880150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Disclaimer</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All people, institutions/organizations, countries, and unions depicted in this game are entirely fictional and have no connection to real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop; A Political-Economic Shop Survival Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small instant-coffee stand at a metro stop in a world that is slowly collapsing, where you’ll have troubles far bigger than “giving change.” And you’ll realize it quickly: in Jasskia, making coffee isn’t enough to survive. You have to read the agenda and make the right move at the right time.<br>A daily newspaper brings national and global news; those headlines shake the economy, reshape opportunities, and shift the balance of power across the country. Some days you profit. Some days you simply stay afloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ <strong>The agenda changes everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/fbc862ae433b4e82114375236b4621d1.avif?t=1775013736\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras_big/fbc862ae433b4e82114375236b4621d1.webp?t=1775013736 width=1560 height=400 /></span>Follow the developments through the daily newspaper:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The value of <strong>JL (Jasskia Lida)</strong> can rise or fall, and prices may change instantly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stock market swings; if you want to win, you must track the agenda.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain conditions and opportunities across the country can take shape along with the news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ <strong>Meet people, see the country for what it is</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/c86d07e16ea294267ac09708cef42926.avif?t=1775013736\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras_big/c86d07e16ea294267ac09708cef42926.webp?t=1775013736 width=1560 height=400 /></span>Meet over <strong>70 NPCs</strong>. Help them, or talk about the agenda:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every NPC has their own routine. Your relationship directly affects how likely they are to shop at your place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping people boosts your reputation. The higher your reputation, the more doors open to larger shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In conversations, you can position yourself as pro-government or opposition, and define your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jasskia, you will sometimes witness unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ <strong>Tenders: big money, big risk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on municipal and governorate tenders. But in Jasskia, entering a tender often means aligning yourself with the tender owner. Being in the right place at the right time is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ <strong>From stand to shop: grow and diversify</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/d8f2520404eecf28301c2250d34147eb.avif?t=1775013736\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras_big/d8f2520404eecf28301c2250d34147eb.webp?t=1775013736 width=1560 height=400 /></span><br>Save up, rent larger shops, and expand your menu:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new coffee machines and add new drinks; the bigger your menu, the more customers you attract.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More space means better decoration and comfort; the comfort you offer directly affects customer count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast and grind your own beans to cut costs, and chase big profits through coffee tenders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own desserts, add them to your menu, and aim for major gains through dessert tenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ <strong>Don’t miss payments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/b466761c980c61e5f31008df55adecf2.avif?t=1775013736\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras_big/b466761c980c61e5f31008df55adecf2.webp?t=1775013736 width=1560 height=400 /></span>Rent, income tax, electricity/water bills, employee wages and insurance premiums. On top of that, surprise extra charges and Jasskia’s dark order. In Jasskia, delaying certain payments can be fatal for a shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is collapsing. The end is approaching.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It creeps closer day by day, and when it arrives, if you don’t have a fortune to pay, it will take either your life or your dignity.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Disclaimer</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All people, institutions/organizations, countries, and unions depicted in this game are entirely fictional and have no connection to r