affects customer count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast and grind your own beans to cut costs, and chase big profits through coffee tenders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own desserts, add them to your menu, and aim for major gains through dessert tenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ <strong>Don’t miss payments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/b466761c980c61e5f31008df55adecf2.avif?t=1775013736\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras_big/b466761c980c61e5f31008df55adecf2.webp?t=1775013736 width=1560 height=400 /></span>Rent, income tax, electricity/water bills, employee wages and insurance premiums. On top of that, surprise extra charges and Jasskia’s dark order. In Jasskia, delaying certain payments can be fatal for a shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is collapsing. The end is approaching.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It creeps closer day by day, and when it arrives, if you don’t have a fortune to pay, it will take either your life or your dignity.</p>", "short_description": "A political-economic shop survival game. In a world nearing its end, the national and global agenda in crisis-stricken Jasskia shifts every day. In the middle of it all, build your business, meet people, witness unsettling truths, find ways to make money, and prepare for the coming end.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/f0a5e40cc3bdf70bd2cf5af0bf4f2ba1cc92c2ea/header.jpg?t=1775013736", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38